<h1>Supplier shutdown planning</h1><p>Plan stock before a supplier holiday or factory shutdown, such as Chinese New Year. Enter the dates from a notice you have checked. StockChief uses recorded warehouse issues, current promises and dated incoming stock. It never supplies missing dates, demand or prices.</p>
<% if(locked){ %><section class="card"><h2><span class="badge">Growth</span> Supplier shutdown suggestions</h2><p>Growth can calculate a suggestion. Pro and Custom keep plans current on their own and, within your limit, prepare the purchase draft before the last order date.</p><a class="btn" href="/settings/billing">Upgrade</a></section><% }else{ %>
<% if(shadow){ %><p class="notice">The first 14 days are Watch only. Suggestions are available; saving plans, granting routine authority and preparing agent purchase drafts wait until the watch period ends.</p><% } %>
<section class="card"><h2>Use a checked supplier notice</h2><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-shutdowns/preview" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
<label class="rm-field"><span>Exact supplier names, one per line</span><textarea name="supplierName" rows="3" maxlength="5000" required></textarea></label><p>Several suppliers closing for the same holiday share one set of dates. Each gets its own plan and purchase order.</p><label class="rm-field"><span>Exact warehouse or stock-location name</span><input name="locationName" maxlength="240" required></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Supplier notice reference</span><input name="reference" maxlength="200" required></label>
<label class="rm-field"><span>StockChief SKU codes, one per line (optional)</span><textarea name="skuCodes" rows="6" maxlength="50000"></textarea></label><p>Leave the SKU codes empty to plan every product each supplier is the main supplier for that sold at least twice here in the last 90 days.</p>
<label class="rm-field"><span>Last date the supplier accepts an order before closing</span><input name="lastOrderDate" type="date" required></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Closure starts</span><input name="closedFrom" type="date" required></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Closure ends</span><input name="closedThrough" type="date" required></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Next possible delivery to this warehouse</span><input name="nextArrivalDate" type="date" required></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Extra coverage days you want, including zero</span><input name="extraCoverDays" type="number" min="0" max="90" required></label>
<p>Up to 250 whole-unit quantity products per supplier and 50 owned stock locations inside the chosen warehouse. Each product needs its saved supplier pack, minimum, multiple and cost. Lots, serials and measured stock need separate review.</p><button class="btn">Review shutdown stock suggestion</button></form></section>
<% if(drafts.length||notes.length){ %><section class="card"><h2>Review the exact plan<%= drafts.length>1?'s':'' %></h2>
<% if(notes.length){ %><aside class="notice"><strong>Not planned</strong><ul><% for(const note of notes){ %><li><%= note.supplier %><%= note.sku?' · '+note.sku:'' %>: <%= note.reason %></li><% } %></ul></aside><% } %>
<% for(const draft of drafts){ %><%- include('supplier-shutdown-body',{facts:draft}) %><% } %>
<% if(!drafts.length){ %><p>There is nothing to plan for these suppliers.</p><% }else if(['pro','enterprise'].includes(plan)){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-shutdowns" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><% for(const key of ['locationId','reference','lastOrderDate','closedFrom','closedThrough','nextArrivalDate','extraCoverDays']){ %><input type="hidden" name="<%= key %>" value="<%= drafts[0].scope[key] %>"><% } %><input type="hidden" name="plans" value="<%= JSON.stringify(drafts.map(d=>({supplierId:d.scope.supplierId,skuIds:d.scope.skuIds,sourceFingerprint:d.sourceFingerprint}))) %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I checked the supplier notice, dates, stock basis and exact private plan<%= drafts.length>1?'s':'' %>. Saving does not place an order.</label><button class="btn" <%= shadow?'disabled':'' %>>Save reviewed private shutdown plan<%= drafts.length>1?'s':'' %></button></form><% }else{ %><p><span class="badge">Pro</span> Growth gives this suggestion. Saving plans, keeping them current and preparing their purchase drafts requires Pro.</p><a class="btn" href="/settings/billing">Upgrade</a><% } %></section><% } %><% } %>
<% if(rows.length){ %><section class="card"><h2>Saved shutdown scopes</h2><% for(const p of rows){ %><article><h3><% if(!locked){ %><a href="/autopilot/supplier-shutdowns/<%= p.id %>"><%= p.supplier_name %> · <%= p.location_name %> · <%= p.reference %></a><% }else{ %><%= p.supplier_name %> · <%= p.location_name %> · <%= p.reference %><% } %></h3><p><%= p.enabled?(['pro','enterprise'].includes(plan)?'Private plan updates enabled':'Private plan updates paused on this plan'):'Private plan updates stopped' %>. <%= p.last_issue||'' %></p><% if(p.enabled){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-shutdowns/<%= p.id %>/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><button class="btn" name="stop" value="yes">Stop shutdown plan updates</button></form><% } %></article><% } %></section><% } %>
<nav aria-label="Saved shutdown pages"><% if(page>1){ %><a href="/autopilot/supplier-shutdowns?page=<%= page-1 %>">Newer shutdown scopes</a><% } %> <% if(more){ %><a href="/autopilot/supplier-shutdowns?page=<%= page+1 %>">Older shutdown scopes</a><% } %></nav><p>AI credits used: 0.</p>
